<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: TENNIS-CZECH OPEN WOMEN'S RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CZECH OPEN WOMEN'S RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>KARLOVY VARY, Czech Republic 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second round results at the Czech Open women's tennis tournament on Thursday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>8-Henrietta Nagyova (Slovakia) beat Katarzyna Nowak (Poland) 6-1 6-4</p>
<p>Lenka Cenkova (Czech Rep) beat Janette Husarova (Slovakia) 7-5 6-1.</p>
</text>
